[LISTAUTO
[THIS PROGRAM EXAMINES THE LAST WORD IN EACH BLOCK OF A TAPE ON UNIT 1 , ASSUMING IT TO BE THE OUTPUT TAPE FROM AUTOCORR.
[A LIST IS PREPARED, FOUR COLUMNS AND 64 LINES PER PAGE, OF THE DATA BLOCKS FROM WHICH EACH BLOCK OF CORRELATION IS DERIVED.
[THE BLOCK NUMBER OF THE OUTPUT TAPE IS FOLLOWED BY THE BLOCK NUMBER OF THE DATA AND WHETHER THE DATA SET BEGINS AT THE 1ST., 2ND, 3RD OR 4TH EVOKED POTENTIAL IN THAT BLOCK.
